    "closure": "adjunction genus contradiction",
    "statement": "The two-section elementary modification would make the integral clean curve isomorphic to P^1 and hence smooth of genus zero. Adjunction gives genus (rho-1)(m-1)=(4m-2)(m-1)>0 for a smooth bidegree-(rho,m) divisor when m>1. Therefore that branch is impossible, and every clean failure has the unique-section splitting O+O(1-rho)+O(-rho)^(m-2).",
